      "id": "R0000012_c7d0d17711",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source": "Congratulations to the new counselors of CAMP LAKEVIEW!\nPlease help us ensure the camp meets the quality expectations of our visitors.\nWe hope you have a fun and rewarding summer working with us!\nSincerely,",
      "translation": "祝贺湖景营地的新辅导员们！\n请协助我们确保营地达到访客的品质期望。\n希望你们与我们一起工作的这个夏天充满乐趣、收获满满！\n谨启，",
